s":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-042-jiangshi-near-family-rendered:p002:m0025","start":286,"end":288,"surface":"德隣","kind":"person","person_id":"qfs_t8x_ez4_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-042-jiangshi-near-family-rendered:p002:m0026","start":290,"end":291,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"z5d_9zy_u5h_B","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-042-jiangshi-near-family-rendered","book_id":"b-nanqishu-042","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-042-current-rendered-jiangshi-near-family"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p003","text":"子隆在荊州，好辭賦，數集僚友，朓以文才，尤被賞愛，流連晤對，不捨日夕。長史王秀之以朓年少相動，密以啓聞。世祖敕曰：「侍讀虞雲自宜恒應侍接。朓可還都。」朓道中爲詩寄西府曰：「常恐鷹隼擊，秋菊委嚴霜。寄言罻羅者，寥廓已高翔。」遷新安王中軍記室。朓牋辭子隆曰：「朓聞潢汙之水，思朝宗而每竭；駑蹇之乘，希沃若而中疲。何則？皐壤搖落，對之惆悵；岐路東西，或以嗚悒。況乃服義徒擁，歸志莫從，邈若墜雨，飄似秋蔕。朓實庸流，行能無算，屬天地休明，山川受納，褒採一介，搜揚小善，捨耒場圃，奉筆菟園。東亂三江，西浮七澤，契闊戎旃，從容讌語。長裾日曳，後乘載脂，榮立府廷，恩加顏色。沐髮晞陽，未測涯涘；撫臆論報，早誓肌骨。不悟滄溟未運，波臣自蕩；渤澥方春，旅翮先謝。清切蕃房，寂寥舊蓽。輕舟反泝，弔影獨留，白雲在天，龍門不見。去德滋永，思德滋深。唯待青江可望，候歸艎於春渚；朱邸方開，效蓬心於秋實。如其簪履或存，衽席無改，雖復身填溝壑，猶望妻子知歸。攬涕告辭，悲來橫集。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p003:m0001","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"子隆","kind":"person","person_id":"4tg_ud8_zdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p003:m0002","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"朓","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCBA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p003:m0003","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"王秀之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p003:m0004","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"朓","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCBA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p003:m0005","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"世祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kix_r92_2ed","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p003:m0006","start":60,"end":62,"sur